Our house is small as it is. The rabbi said, and they continue to fight and bicker. And the week finally, finally ends. And he runs to the rabbi and said, Rabbi, help. And the rabbi says, how are things going?

417
00:53:17,130 --> 00:53:18,050
He said, well, worse.

418
