00:58:46,870 --> 00:58:53,550
whether it's 10 minutes in the afternoon where you just listen to the music in your room by yourself with your eyes closed and focused,

473
00:58:55,590 --> 00:58:57,450
appreciating your favorite piece,

474
00:58:59,400 --> 00:59:06,120
taking our time us become wine connoisseurs by also life connoisseurs.

475
00:59:06,720 --> 00:59:09,520
This course in many ways is about life appreciation.

476
00:59:12,660 --> 00:59:13,720
He continues,

