01:00:37,170 --> 01:00:44,910
As far as most people are concerned, the good things in their lives, in their relationships, do not exist.

491
01:00:45,850 --> 01:00:55,210
Because when we're not grateful for them, when we take them for granted, as far as we're concerned, they're not there. And we're numb to these things. We're dead to these things.

492
01:00:55,210 --> 01:01:06,610
And he takes a wake-up call, like a terminal disease, to wake us up, to get us to focus on what is right inside us and all around us all the time.

493
01:01:06,830 --> 01:01:10,030
Why? Why wait? Why wait?

